{#intro}
@summary: Introduction to iatf format
# Introduction

IATF (Indexed Agent Traversal Format) is a document format designed for AI agents.
It keeps a compact INDEX section and a detailed CONTENT section in one file.
Agents can inspect summaries first, then read only relevant sections.
{/intro}

{#usage}
@summary: Basic usage examples
# Usage

Use `iatf rebuild` after editing content.
Use `iatf validate` to check structure and references.
Use `iatf index`, `iatf find`, and `iatf read` for targeted retrieval.
{/usage}

{#next-steps}
@summary: What to do next
# Next Steps

1. Duplicate this file for your own document.
2. Keep section IDs stable.
3. Use `{@usage}` as a pattern for internal references.
